# tabbed_pages.manifest — code-switcher page variants
# =====================================================
# `source.md -> target.md`: after conversion, the converter wraps each run of
# `## <Code> …` sections of source.md in tab markers and writes target.md.
# Register target.md in pages.manifest (if it is a new page) and in the nav.
#
# PILOT (Phase 5): tabbed variant of the multi-code worked examples.
multicode_examples.md -> multicode_examples.md
